This '''Ben Tennyson''' is a "what if" version of [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]].

==Appearance==
Ben's usual clothes consisted of a black-striped, white shirt with short sleeves, military green cargo pants with side pockets with a black belt hidden under his shirt, and black and white sneakers with black stripes. Ben wore the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] on his left wrist.

During gym class at school, he wore a yellow T-shirt and dark blue shorts.

<gallery hideaddbutton="true" bordercolor="transparent" captionalign="center" spacing="small">
GBGR Ben Gym Clothes.png|Ben's gym clothes
</gallery>

==Personality==
Ben's personality is identical to his [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|canon counterpart]] in the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]'''. He is cocky, rebellious, fun-loving, and has a good heart. 

==History==
{{PartStub}}
===Background===
As with every character from ''[[Goodbye and Good Riddance]]'', this version of Ben Tennyson's history is identical to his [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|canon counterpart]] up until the tail end of the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]'''<nowiki>'</nowiki> chronology.

===Ben 10===
After foiling a heist aboard an airship, [[Max Tennyson (Goodbye and Good Riddance)|Max]] told Ben and [[Gwen Tennyson (Goodbye and Good Riddance)|Gwen]] that summer was over and that it was time to head back to [[Bellwood (Classic)|Bellwood]] for the school year, much to Ben's dismay. Ben returned home first, where he greeted [[Sandra Tennyson (Goodbye and Good Riddance)|his]] [[Carl Tennyson (Goodbye and Good Riddance)|parents]] and said his goodbyes to Gwen and Max. Before leaving, Max told Ben to keep the use of the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] on the down-low for the time being, much to Ben's disappointment, as he had hoped to continue fighting crime in [[Bellwood (Classic)|Bellwood]].

After getting settled back in at home, Ben used [[XLR8 (Classic)|XLR8]] to perform various chores quickly. However, he was still disappointed about the road trip coming to an end.

At school, Ben's reputation as a loser caught up to him, as he was repeatedly shunned and unable to tell anyone his secret. Things soon came to a head when drones attacked Ben during his gym class. He defeated them with the aid of Max but returned home to find [[Vilgax (Goodbye and Good Riddance)|Vilgax]] holding his father hostage. He turns into Cannonbolt to stop Vilgax thus showing Carl his secret.

==Powers and Abilities==
===Equipment===
[[File:Riddance (1089).png|thumb|Omnitrix]]
Ben possesses the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]]. Through it, he can transform into various aliens and utilize their respective powers.

